# Oracle Consumer Test Results

This file stores test snapshots for the oracle consumer pattern.

## Tests

- test_oracle_init: ✓ Initializes oracle consumer with oracle address and max age
- test_get_price: ✓ Fetches prices from oracle contract
- test_get_price_data: ✓ Retrieves detailed price data with decimals and timestamp
- test_calculate_value: ✓ Calculates asset values based on oracle prices
- test_get_prices_multiple: ✓ Fetches multiple prices in single call
- test_set_oracle: ✓ Updates oracle contract address
- test_set_max_age: ✓ Updates maximum data age threshold
